### Trees (procedural, baked for the game)
- trees/trees.glb (2.8 MB): branch structures generated with ez-tree by Dan Greenheck
  (https://github.com/dgreenheck/ez-tree, MIT licence; presets oak_medium, aspen_medium, pine_medium and
  oak_small, our seeds and leaf settings) and baked to geometry only. ez-tree's own bark and leaf images are
  not used: the trees wear the game's CC0 photo bark (tex/bark_brown_02, Poly Haven) and the ambientCG leaf
  cards above (foliage/*.png). See src/world/props/trees.ts.

